néficiez également du statut fiscal LMNP amortissable, vous permettant une exonération d'impôt sur vos revenus locatifs.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"100 Av. Crampel","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImYxMTQ4NmVlNDdlZjU5OTI1NmMzZGI1YzI1MmM2Y2JmNGY1ZGNiZDUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI2ZWJmMDhkMWY5MmU4MjA3ZjQ4ZjQzZDlmZDg1MTBmNiJ9?signature=255a0f0524339ab0a3e04cc05258cbe6575e10c7ac22d161ca7d6b30d1ddba6b","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjcxMTJjMGI1Nzk1YzljOWU1MzVmYWMwOTBkNmY1MDk4NjA2Yjk0NTkiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJmOTc3Y2I3MDMzZTJmYWYxMGJmMmMwNzdlMWQ0MTE4YiJ9?signature=bad12af9f33a77631274127da29ad61ccbdd5b707ba66c559054a91bd4089ed8","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImJjMTU3Mjg0MDEyMDM1NTUyZDEyOGVkNjNiNWM1NWQwMjgwYjQ5YjkiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI3MzY0N2Q3YTdlODdhMGJkZTAwNzFjODg0ZWJmZTYzMiJ9?signature=f1308219e268312ae4a68f79639c91fa21e3b066d85dfe11e619a30fea6cb2ed","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjU1NzU0NDgyZTg5YzUzNzRjMzcwNjc5ZWQ2OTkzNzM3ODI1MmI0NmIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJmYjQ3OGMyNzVkYzZlNWU1ZDdmZTIyNmQ5Y2M5NjMwNiJ9?signature=7c8e17c7a23e6b95ea7a8b2f4e44c0dbbf398a8a676e20d725f9d318795e3744","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijc3YzU0YmI3Yzg4Y2M0NmZhM2UyYWE3ZWRlZWU4OWY4MzI3ZjA4Y2YiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ